prayerTemplate:
PRAYER

In the light of the facts and circumstances stated above, it is most respectfully prayed that this Hon'ble Court may graciously be pleased to:

a) Pass a decree of divorce dissolving the marriage between the Petitioner and the Respondent solemnised on {marriage_date} at {marriage_place} under Section 13 of the Hindu Marriage Act, 1955;
b) Award costs of this petition to the Petitioner;
c) Pass any other order(s) as this Hon'ble Court may deem fit and proper in the interest of justice.

And for this act of kindness, the Petitioner shall ever pray.
